WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:37.280 --> 01:39.910
Because I like you.

01:41.310 --> 01:44.950
I can't hold back my feelings anymore...

01:45.380 --> 01:46.820
Is it no use?

01:46.820 --> 01:49.960
I was hoping we could go out.

01:50.460 --> 01:54.730
What's the meaning of this?
Chocolat is that popular?

01:54.730 --> 01:58.090
And that guy is the famous
middle schooler,

01:58.090 --> 02:02.530
second only to Pierre in popularity, Sasaoka-senpai!

02:02.530 --> 02:04.470
I can't believe it!

02:04.940 --> 02:07.040
Anyway, just give it some thought.

02:07.040 --> 02:10.840
If we can't go out right now, I'll
wait for you for two years...

02:12.480 --> 02:16.780
Just like Vanilla said, the effect of the
"Super Popular Barret" is amazing.

02:17.250 --> 02:20.320
I've gotten this popular just from putting it on...

02:22.490 --> 02:24.860
Goodbye, Heart Hair Ornament

02:27.890 --> 02:28.990
Alright!

02:29.460 --> 02:32.300
Well, you just get right down to business, Chocolat.

02:32.300 --> 02:38.000
Hmph! It's all because of that "Super Popular Barret" Vanilla-chama told you about.

02:38.000 --> 02:40.130
Thanks, Vanilla.

02:40.130 --> 02:42.470
I'm just glad I checked the Magical
World Mail Order Catalogue.

02:42.940 --> 02:46.720
I spent all the ecure I had saved
up, but it was totally worth it!

02:47.080 --> 02:52.980
However, don't make a mistake! Your
popularity is all because of that item.

02:52.980 --> 02:54.850
That's fine with me!

02:54.850 --> 02:58.260
This is the first time I've ever been this popular since coming to the Human World.

02:58.760 --> 03:05.130
Oh, Chocolat, you are a jewel of the
night, a star sparkling like caviar!

03:05.130 --> 03:11.080
I beg of you, please don't stir this
heart of mine so, mon amie.

03:11.440 --> 03:16.570
I knew the Barret would be effective
when it worked on Robin yesterday.

03:16.570 --> 03:19.100
You can be pleased with yourself now,

03:19.520 --> 03:23.480
but the "Super Popular Barret" is only effective for 24 hours, you know.

03:23.480 --> 03:28.640
I know that. That's why I have to
get hearts like crazy until then!

03:29.220 --> 03:30.390
I'm goin' for it!

03:31.590 --> 03:32.850
Mornin'!

03:33.120 --> 03:33.860
Hey.

03:33.860 --> 03:34.860
Good morning!

03:39.230 --> 03:40.860
Ah, wow!

03:41.770 --> 03:44.370
That's... Kato, right...

03:44.370 --> 03:47.200
Somehow, she's... awesomely cute today.

03:47.640 --> 03:49.440
Yeah... cute...

03:50.410 --> 03:52.110
The effect is perfect!

03:52.610 --> 03:55.980
Hey, Kato, wanna go see
a movie after school?

03:55.980 --> 03:59.340
Or why don't you come to my house and
watch an alien autopsy video instead?

03:59.340 --> 04:05.360
Or better than a movie or aliens, I know a great
place for crepes! Let's go eat some together!

04:07.460 --> 04:11.800
When two figures match up precisely,
those figures are congruent.

04:11.800 --> 04:16.170
If placed on top of one another the shapes
are the same and the angles are the same.

04:16.170 --> 04:21.070
There is a correspondance between
the shape and the angles.

04:17.400 --> 04:19.240
There it is, there it is!

04:19.240 --> 04:21.070
Now, this is popularity!

04:22.510 --> 04:24.180
Agrandissment!

04:24.180 --> 04:26.810
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

04:30.950 --> 04:31.720
Wand!

04:40.220 --> 04:40.990
Alright!

04:42.530 --> 04:47.900
Your hearts... Pick up!

04:58.310 --> 05:03.780
Ah, to be able to get all these hearts
so easily... and so many...

05:04.180 --> 05:06.320
Good for you, Chocolat-chan!

05:06.320 --> 05:10.490
Man, if I knew it was like this, I would have
bought the "Super Popular Barret" earlier.

05:10.860 --> 05:15.990
See? But if you take too many hearts too fast...

05:16.690 --> 05:19.160
Okay, I'm gonna try and get some more.

05:19.160 --> 05:21.050
Chocolat-chan...

05:21.600 --> 05:27.010
Well, it's probably okay. The "Super Popular
Barret" will only work for another 12 hours or so.

05:27.370 --> 05:28.760
Hello!

05:28.760 --> 05:31.760
Oh? It's Kato-san from class A.

05:35.640 --> 05:39.820
Go, go, let' s go. Love, love, Chocolat!

05:39.820 --> 05:43.660
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

05:44.060 --> 05:45.820
Agrandissment!

05:45.820 --> 05:48.730
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

05:49.190 --> 05:54.770
Your hearts... Pick up!

05:58.140 --> 06:01.970
Go, go, let's go. Love, love, Chocolat!

06:01.970 --> 06:06.410
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

06:06.410 --> 06:11.760
Your hearts... Pick up!

06:14.340 --> 06:17.960
Go, go, let's go. Love, love, Chocolat!

06:17.960 --> 06:21.460
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

06:22.190 --> 06:26.820
Your hearts... Pick up!

06:29.360 --> 06:33.070
Go, go, let's go. Love, love, Chocolat!

06:33.070 --> 06:36.440
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

06:36.440 --> 06:39.980
Go, go, let's go. Love, love, Chocolat!

06:39.980 --> 06:41.650
Love, love, my love...

06:41.650 --> 06:44.610
Your hearts... Pick up!

06:46.670 --> 06:48.170
Pick up!

06:48.170 --> 06:50.420
Pick up!

06:52.220 --> 06:53.690
Kyahoo!

06:53.690 --> 06:56.630
Bravo! Thank you, everybody!

06:56.630 --> 06:59.600
Go, go, let's go. Love, love, Chocolat!

06:59.600 --> 07:03.500
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

07:03.500 --> 07:07.510
Go, go, let's go. Love, love, Chocolat!

07:07.240 --> 07:09.370
Thank you, everybody!

07:07.510 --> 07:09.370
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

07:09.370 --> 07:11.380
Love, love, my love, lovely Chocolat!

07:20.080 --> 07:24.590
If it's a sign the Ogres are going after
the Queen Candidates or Royaume...

07:24.590 --> 07:26.390
What a sad state of affairs.

07:26.760 --> 07:30.230
She just got her hands on a
really effective magic item.

07:30.230 --> 07:31.930
It's only temporary.

07:31.930 --> 07:35.300
Speaking of which... Collecting
that amount of hearts,

07:35.300 --> 07:37.520
it's just how her mother was.

07:42.510 --> 07:45.860
So? What about the signs of the Ogres?

07:46.980 --> 07:49.780
There's no mistaking it, they're inside that school.

07:49.780 --> 07:50.980
That school?

07:50.980 --> 07:53.350
Then Chocolat and Vanilla are in too much danger.

07:53.890 --> 07:56.120
Can I inform them about it?

07:56.490 --> 07:59.820
Everything will be decided by the
Queen Selection Committee.

07:59.820 --> 08:03.230
We can only perform the duties that are set to us.

08:03.230 --> 08:07.870
But, if we have such specific information
about the Ogres,

08:07.870 --> 08:09.630
why are we just leaving them to their own devices?

08:10.070 --> 08:14.390
Putting that aside, until we get orders,
we cannot play our hand.

08:15.210 --> 08:18.810
At any rate, I'd better tell those two about the Ogres.

08:19.910 --> 08:22.390
Alright! I got a truckload today!

08:24.080 --> 08:24.850
Hey.

08:26.420 --> 08:27.750
Pierre.

08:27.750 --> 08:29.390
Aren't you popular, Chocolat?

08:30.190 --> 08:31.390
Same to you.

08:32.060 --> 08:33.360
Impertinent girl...

08:33.360 --> 08:36.430
Just because you're popular for
once, don't get your hopes up.

08:36.430 --> 08:40.260
This state of affairs is fickle, like
the end of typhoon season.

08:40.260 --> 08:44.960
Yes, you're really troubling those
boys, abusing them like that.

08:50.680 --> 08:52.480
W-What?

08:56.250 --> 08:57.480
I don't hate you.

08:59.020 --> 09:01.540
I'll quickly break through those
confrontational instincts of your heart,

09:01.540 --> 09:03.100
and snatch away your pride...

09:03.620 --> 09:06.360
You're really charming right now.

09:07.810 --> 09:08.760
Hmph!

09:24.010 --> 09:25.980
He touched my cheek...

09:25.980 --> 09:28.550
And said I was charming...

09:28.550 --> 09:29.580
Chocolat-chan!

09:30.080 --> 09:31.090
Is something the matter?

09:31.350 --> 09:32.920
I-It's nothing!

09:32.920 --> 09:35.350
It looks like you've collected a lot of hearts.

09:35.350 --> 09:36.800
Yeah! It was a cinch!

09:37.120 --> 09:39.320
Okay, then you can stop now, right?

09:39.320 --> 09:40.260
If you don't, then...

09:40.260 --> 09:41.730
You've got to be kidding!

09:42.260 --> 09:44.560
I might not have another chance like this!

09:45.060 --> 09:47.200
I'm gonna get me a ton more!

09:47.800 --> 09:49.430
Chocolat-chan!

09:51.040 --> 09:53.340
Man, she's going nuts with that thing.

09:53.340 --> 09:55.210
How shameful...

09:55.210 --> 09:57.210
That's what you always say.

10:00.650 --> 10:01.740
Hi!

10:02.150 --> 10:04.610
Hey, wanna play basketball after school?

10:05.780 --> 10:07.480
I'll pass on that today.

10:09.590 --> 10:11.420
Mimura, what's wrong?

10:14.360 --> 10:15.260
Hi!

10:17.600 --> 10:20.030
Hey, wanna play basketball after school?

10:20.030 --> 10:23.130
Sorry, I'm tired today, for some reason.

10:24.900 --> 10:27.410
Akira, wanna play basketball after school?

10:27.410 --> 10:32.180
For some reason I feel tired around
you. Sorry, maybe next time...

10:36.780 --> 10:40.280
That's weird. What's with everybody?

10:54.500 --> 10:59.040
Man, what's with this? I was so popular just before...

11:00.170 --> 11:01.970
Quite a short time, eh?

11:01.970 --> 11:03.890
Everyone's avoiding you, Chocolat.

11:04.180 --> 11:06.410
Why? What do you mean?

11:06.410 --> 11:07.930
You see, Chocolat-chan...

11:08.780 --> 11:11.190
I heard this before from my mother.

11:11.650 --> 11:16.950
She said when you take hearts, the human who gets their heart taken is really drained.

11:16.950 --> 11:20.450
That's why she said not to take too many too quickly.

11:20.450 --> 11:22.090
Huh? Really?

11:22.530 --> 11:26.490
So that's why everyone I took
hearts from is feeling bad?

11:26.900 --> 11:29.200
Such short-lived popularity, eh?

11:29.200 --> 11:33.570
Well, you just borrowed the power of that
item, so it's only a temporary love.

11:33.570 --> 11:35.250
Aww...

11:35.670 --> 11:36.970
But, Chocolat-chan...

11:38.080 --> 11:41.010
It seems there are still people
who are interested in you.

11:41.850 --> 11:42.750
Look, over there.

11:46.050 --> 11:49.390
He's been looking closely at you
for a while now, Chocolat-chan.

11:58.900 --> 12:00.300
A pink heart!

12:03.860 --> 12:07.620
Ahh, I'm so tired...

12:07.620 --> 12:12.670
Me too... It's like all the energy
in my body has been drained...

12:13.240 --> 12:15.910
I just want to get home and go to sleep...

12:17.750 --> 12:19.980
I guess I took everybody's hearts too much.

12:20.580 --> 12:21.880
Will they be okay?

12:22.290 --> 12:25.460
As long as you don't take their
hearts for a while, it'll be fine.

12:25.460 --> 12:29.390
Anyway, that heart at lunch was an
amazing pink color, you know?

12:29.390 --> 12:31.300
But who was that kid?

12:31.300 --> 12:34.630
I think he's Moriyama-kun from the soccer club.

12:35.270 --> 12:37.370
I didn't have any idea who he was.

12:37.370 --> 12:40.700
I think he's been looking at you
for a long time, Chocolat-chan.

12:41.170 --> 12:42.270
Really?

12:45.340 --> 12:51.050
Kato-san! I'm Moriyama Taro, from class B.

12:51.480 --> 12:54.990
Yeah, I know. You're in the soccer club, right?

12:54.990 --> 12:56.650
Y-Yeah...

12:56.650 --> 12:57.750
Want something?

12:58.920 --> 12:59.720
Kato-san...

13:01.330 --> 13:02.800
You're cute!

13:02.800 --> 13:04.260
Really?

13:04.260 --> 13:09.050
Um... that heart shaped hair pin, it's cute, you know?

13:09.400 --> 13:12.940
Hair pin? Oh, the barret.

13:12.940 --> 13:15.970
Oh, it's called a barret...

13:15.970 --> 13:18.520
Hey, this is the first time we've talked, right?

13:20.410 --> 13:21.480
No...

13:27.350 --> 13:31.260
It's like a dream, being able to talk together
with you like this, Kato-san.

13:31.260 --> 13:33.220
Oh, that's going too far...

13:33.220 --> 13:35.230
Let's get along together, okay?

13:47.440 --> 13:48.510
Yeah, let's...

13:55.050 --> 13:56.050
What is it?

13:56.050 --> 13:58.250
It's nothing.

13:58.720 --> 14:02.090
Are you feeling bad, maybe?

14:02.420 --> 14:07.240
Um, how should I say this...
Do you feel tired around me?

14:07.630 --> 14:10.190
Why? It's nothing like that.

14:10.190 --> 14:12.950
I finally get to speak with you like this, Kato-san...

14:13.330 --> 14:15.170
There's no way I'd be tired.

14:18.040 --> 14:21.000
Is it okay to take his heart?

14:22.640 --> 14:25.010
Oh yeah, want something to drink?

14:25.780 --> 14:28.260
I'll go get some juice or something
at the school store.

14:29.110 --> 14:30.820
Naw, I'm good.

14:30.820 --> 14:33.020
Then, are you hungry?

14:33.020 --> 14:35.490
But we just ate lunch...

14:35.490 --> 14:41.290
Ah, I see. Is there anything you need, Kato-san?

14:41.980 --> 14:46.330
I'm not cool, and I'm not interesting to talk to...

14:46.330 --> 14:49.990
So I figured if I did something for you...

14:51.240 --> 14:54.000
Take it now, those beautiful feelings!

14:57.310 --> 14:58.180
Yeah.

14:58.780 --> 15:03.080
Agrandissment! Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

15:03.550 --> 15:08.820
Your heart... Pick up!

15:13.390 --> 15:16.230
I took it... Such a beautiful heart.

15:16.230 --> 15:20.730
So now I don't think you'll feel so special about me.

15:21.400 --> 15:24.230
Huh? What was I doing just now?

15:24.940 --> 15:27.040
It's like time stopped for a second...

15:27.610 --> 15:29.740
I guess I just drifted off there for a bit.

15:29.740 --> 15:32.360
Since I finally got to talk to you like this, Kato-san.

15:32.360 --> 15:34.850
The heart's there again.

15:34.850 --> 15:40.150
It's not because of the barret. It looks like
he's really fallen for you, Chocolat.

15:41.090 --> 15:43.500
When a human has such passionate feelings,

15:43.500 --> 15:46.720
the heart will come back, no matter how many times you take it.

15:48.630 --> 15:53.900
Why is this pink color of love even
more beautiful than it was before?

15:56.970 --> 15:59.970
So you got all of these from Moriyama-kun?

15:59.970 --> 16:03.940
Yeah. He really just keeps popping
out those hearts for me.

16:03.940 --> 16:05.610
Really pretty colored hearts.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.940
Isn't that good, Chocolat-chan?

16:08.380 --> 16:10.510
You have someone who feels like that about you.

16:10.510 --> 16:12.180
But is it okay?

16:12.180 --> 16:14.620
I think I might have taken too many...

16:14.620 --> 16:18.250
Moriyama-kun's into sports,
so I think it should be okay.

16:20.220 --> 16:24.460
No matter whose heart you take, never
forget those beautiful feelings.

16:25.000 --> 16:28.000
Because it's the feeling of thanks that is given back.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.470
That's what hearts are.

16:29.970 --> 16:30.670
Robin...

16:31.670 --> 16:38.220
By the way, do you remember the color of each
heart you've taken and who it was from today?

16:40.840 --> 16:41.930
I don't remember.

16:42.350 --> 16:45.720
So you were taking hearts that randomly, huh?

16:47.820 --> 16:52.690
Your mother had more love for
each and every heart she took.

16:53.960 --> 16:54.720
Mama?

17:16.280 --> 17:17.050
There!

17:17.590 --> 17:18.720
I'm not done yet!

17:19.980 --> 17:20.920
One more time!

17:36.830 --> 17:39.800
Sorry for watching you like that.

17:40.910 --> 17:42.080
Kato-san...

17:42.710 --> 17:45.480
You really do look tired, after all.

17:45.480 --> 17:48.310
Oh, no... Just this is nothin'!

17:48.950 --> 17:50.810
Okay, good then.

17:50.810 --> 17:53.210
It's just like that day you were watching me.

17:54.320 --> 17:55.050
That day?

17:55.690 --> 18:00.290
It doesn't seem like you remember, but
today's not the first time we've talked.

18:01.560 --> 18:06.030
I failed to become a regular on the
team, and was feeling down.

18:06.700 --> 18:09.670
Even though I practiced so hard, everday!

18:09.670 --> 18:11.530
I still couldn't do it right.

18:13.540 --> 18:16.540
All my friends just made fun of me.

18:17.040 --> 18:23.510
But I love soccer! I wanted to get better,
and get to play in the games.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.020
And then, on that day...

18:33.320 --> 18:36.290
Taro! You suck at soccer, man!

18:36.290 --> 18:38.880
Just give up on being a regular!

18:38.880 --> 18:40.530
Yeah, that ain't gonna happen!

18:44.230 --> 18:47.570
I really thought about quitting back then...

18:49.910 --> 18:51.840
Ah, don't worry about those guys.

18:53.440 --> 18:58.280
I'm also trying my best at something,
even though I always screw up.

18:58.880 --> 19:02.650
But if you don't give up, someday
you'll be good at it, I'm sure!

19:02.650 --> 19:04.240
So you do your best too, okay?

19:05.390 --> 19:07.120
Okay...

19:07.120 --> 19:08.620
Chocolat-chan!

19:10.360 --> 19:11.800
Hey, you're late!

19:11.800 --> 19:13.630
I'm sorry... Were you waiting?

19:13.630 --> 19:17.530
Because of what you said back
then, I kept trying hard.

19:19.400 --> 19:22.180
Oh yeah, that happened.

19:22.180 --> 19:24.470
Sorry, I totally forgot.

19:25.080 --> 19:29.890
I was really happy. Even though
I still haven't left the bench.

19:29.890 --> 19:32.280
But I ain't gonna quit soccer.

19:32.280 --> 19:37.530
Just like you said, Kato-san, if I work hard everyday, one day my dream might come true!

19:38.260 --> 19:38.960
Yeah!

19:55.310 --> 19:57.710
Sugar Sugar Rune... Choco Rune...

20:18.000 --> 20:19.300
I did it!

20:24.430 --> 20:27.780
It looks like he got my dream present.

20:27.780 --> 20:32.010
Thank you, Moriyama-kun, for all those warm hearts.

20:32.510 --> 20:35.290
I wish that one day your dream really comes true.

20:40.880 --> 20:43.390
So, how is their condition?

20:43.390 --> 20:45.260
Are they doing well?

20:45.260 --> 20:47.020
Yes, there is nothing to worry about.

20:47.460 --> 20:50.770
And I think that Chocolat has learned
something important.

20:51.130 --> 20:53.930
I see. I am glad to hear that.

20:53.930 --> 20:56.470
I leave them in your care.

20:57.300 --> 20:58.100
As you wish.

21:03.110 --> 21:07.440
Without the effect of the "Super Popular
Barret", you aren't popular at all!

21:07.440 --> 21:11.580
But with all those hearts you collected
yesterday you could buy another item.

21:11.580 --> 21:14.690
Well, I was thinking I'd just try on my own today.

21:14.690 --> 21:16.890
If I word hard, everyday...

21:18.090 --> 21:20.560
Chocolat said "work hard"!

21:20.560 --> 21:22.130
I can't believe it!

21:22.130 --> 21:24.630
She's a totally different person!

21:24.900 --> 21:26.730
Quiet, you.

21:26.730 --> 21:28.430
Yo, Kato-san!

21:28.430 --> 21:29.970
Ah, Moriyama-kun!

21:30.300 --> 21:33.280
I had this awesome dream last night.

21:33.280 --> 21:35.730
I dreamed that I became a regular and scored the winning goal!

21:36.040 --> 21:38.730
Oh? Maybe that dream will come true.

21:38.730 --> 21:40.880
Yeah, maybe it will!

21:40.880 --> 21:44.490
The team captain just said that he
might put me in the next game!

21:44.980 --> 21:47.650
Really? That's awesome!

21:47.650 --> 21:50.090
Well, just as a substitute, though.

21:50.090 --> 21:51.990
Even as a substitute, that's amazing!

21:51.990 --> 21:52.920
Do your best, okay?

21:54.060 --> 21:54.920
Yeah!

22:00.360 --> 22:03.370
Words are like magic.

22:03.370 --> 22:06.870
With one word, you can make someone
feel down, or happy.

22:06.870 --> 22:07.470
Yeah!

22:11.110 --> 22:11.840
Take this!

22:23.200 --> 22:29.530
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.620 --> 22:31.030
"Love"

22:31.940 --> 22:35.450
A magic spell.

22:37.580 --> 22:44.860
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.290 --> 22:54.360
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.040 --> 23:00.310
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.910 --> 23:03.970
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.280 --> 23:11.350
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.720 --> 23:16.160
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.160 --> 23:26.270
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.330 --> 23:35.240
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.980 --> 23:53.710
At our school it seems there's a clan from the Magic World called "Ogres" that oppose us.

23:54.250 --> 23:56.720
I think that it's got to be Pierre.

23:57.190 --> 23:59.810
That guy's aiming for my heart.

24:00.520 --> 24:05.000
In that case, I'll take his heart first instead!

24:06.020 --> 24:07.890
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.890 --> 24:10.390
Pierre's secret, the diary's secret.

24:11.000 --> 24:12.950
If you don't watch it, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.950 --> 24:13.770
Thanks!
